# Track 5 — Universal Winner/Profile Result Projection — COMPLETE

Date: 2026-09-09
Branch: `build/initial-product`
Application SHA: `f24c8c25612182db3c12351185fa54be227a8252`
Commit: `feat: project Track 5 tuning results into universal context`
Windows CI: #1016 — SUCCESS
Run id: `34425901211`

## Verified scope

- Added a pure/read-only universal result projection seam over the existing specialized `TuningResult` path.
- Added `UniversalTuningEvidenceProjection`, retaining the exact existing `CandidateEvidence` object plus its exact Slice 3 `UniversalTuningCandidate` binding.
- Added `UniversalTuningWinnerProjection`, retaining the exact existing `PerformanceProfile`, its exact source `CandidateEvidence`, and its exact Slice 3 universal candidate binding.
- Added `UniversalTuningResultProjection`, retaining stable `GameIdentity`, exact resolved `AdapterId`, the exact source `TuningResult`, evidence projections and winner projections.
- Added `BlueStacksUniversalTuningResultBridge.Project(...)` as correlation-only logic. It performs no measurement, scoring, validation, winner selection, persistence, mutation or discovery.
- Existing `AutoTunerEngine.SelectWinners(...)` remains the only authority producing the specialized five winner roles.
- The projection preserves the exact existing winner roles and order: Maximum FPS, Lowest Latency, Stability, Quality and Recommended.
- The projection preserves `EvidenceLevel` exactly. `Observed` evidence remains `Observed`; universal binding metadata cannot promote it to `Validated`.
- A result with only `Observed` evidence and no specialized winners projects with zero winners. The universal layer never invents a winner.
- Stable workload consistency is fail closed: `TuningResult.Game` must match `candidateSpace.Identity.LegacyGameKind`.
- Adapter authority is fail closed: `candidateSpace.AdapterId` and `candidateSpace.Identity.AdapterId` must both be nonblank and match after normalization.
- Every source `CandidateEvidence` must map to exactly one Slice 3 specialized↔universal binding. Missing or ambiguous bindings fail closed.
- Every specialized winner must trace to exactly one existing source evidence configuration and then to exactly one Slice 3 binding. Missing/ambiguous winner provenance fails closed.
- Correlation uses the existing specialized candidate/profile fields; no fuzzy process/path/name matching was introduced.
- No new profile schema or persisted universal profile authority was introduced.
- No change was made to `AutoTunerRunCoordinator`, `AutoTunerSessionService`, `AutoTunerEngine` scoring/selection, `ProfileService`, Profile Challenge, typed PresentMon benchmark authority, Global Controlled Benchmark Lease, rollback or History.
- No startup discovery/tuning side effect was introduced.

