## Preserved authority boundaries

`Observed != Validated` remains unchanged.

Universal result/winner projection proves only stable workload/adapter correlation and exact provenance back to the existing specialized evidence + candidate binding. It does not create evidence, confidence, validation, winners, recommendation authority, mutation authority or persistence permission.

The downstream authority chain remains controlled direct typed measurement → repeatability/evaluation → exact workload/configuration correlation → machine fingerprint/freshness → explicit validation/promotion authority where applicable.
